    "note": "**M2 — live inspector.** The right panel is now real: the active node's **Kind** + **Status** chips over **X / Y / W / H / Z** fields that *mutate as the parser walks* — each value reads out on the global clock, perfectly in sync with the canvas highlight, the camera, and the Step pill.\n\n**How it's built (depth-safe):**\n- Each numeric field = **one** `%{eif}` expr that steps through the values — *not* a stack of 73 per-step variants (which would blow the ~25 overlay-mask limit on a dense walk).\n- **Kind/Status** chips = a few enable-gated text variants (Root/Frame · Split/Leaf), only the active one lit.\n- **git-diff pulse:** a field flashes a soft green pill the instant its value changes; a value that *doesn't* change (e.g. `Z` here, no overlaps) stays steady — no false flash.\n\nThis layout `2(3[1,1,1],2[2,1])` is deliberately small + asymmetric so you can read every X/Y/W/H change as the walk descends left column → right column.",
